6.775">全</span><span begin="26.775" end="26.971">部</span><span begin="26.971" end="27.148">言</span><span begin="27.148" end="27.594">え</span><span begin="27.594" end="27.807">る</span><span begin="27.807" end="28.014">か</span><span begin="28.014" end="28.560">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">想象中的冒险 能否一字不漏的全部说出来吗</span></p><p begin="28.947" end="35.661" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.947" end="29.331">君</span><span begin="29.331" end="29.524">か</span><span begin="29.524" end="29.772">ら</span><span begin="29.772" end="29.989">聞</span><span begin="29.989" end="30.208">き</span><span begin="30.208" end="30.600">た</span><span begin="30.600" end="30.696">い</span><span begin="30.696" end="31.224">よ</span> <span begin="32.243" end="32.688">何</span><span begin="32.688" end="33.351">回</span><span begin="33.351" end="33.573">目</span><span begin="33.573" end="34.008">の</span><span begin="34.008" end="34.383">僕</span><span begin="34.383" end="34.625">に</span><span begin="34.625" end="34.839">出</span><span begin="34.839" end="35.307">会っ</span><span begin="35.307" end="35.661">た？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我想听你你告诉我 你见到了第几次的我？</span></p><p begin="35.979" end="42.548" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.979" end="36.361">僕</span><span begin="36.361" end="36.625">は</span><span begin="36.625" end="36.826">変</span><span begin="36.826" end="37.042">わ</span><span begin="37.042" end="37.258">り</span><span begin="37.258" end="37.573">ま</span><span begin="37.573" end="37.711">し</span><span begin="37.711" end="38.227">た</span> <span begin="39.319" end="39.890">新</span><span begin="39.890" end="40.058">し</span><span begin="40.058" end="40.315">い</span><span begin="40.315" end="40.760">君</span><span begin="40.760" end="41.003">に</span><span begin="41.003" end="41.236">出</span><span begin="41.236" end="41.524">会</span><span begin="41.524" end="41.680">う</span><span begin="41.680" end="41.842">た</span><span begin="41.842" end="42.056">め</span><span begin="42.056" end="42.548">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">为了与崭新的你相遇 我也做出了改变</span></p><p begin="42.934" end="49.576" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.934" end="43.373">久</span><span begin="43.373" end="43.590">し</span><span begin="43.590" end="43.790">ぶ</span><span begin="43.790" end="44.024">り</span><span begin="44.024" end="44.240">だ</span><span begin="44.240" end="44.717">ねっ</span><span begin="44.717" end="45.179">て</span> <span begin="46.301" end="46.550">言</span><span begin="46.550" end="46.703">え</span><span begin="46.703" end="47.369">た</span><span begin="47.369" end="47.543">な</span><span begin="47.543" end="48.004">ら</span><span begin="48.004" end="48.179">こ</span><span begin="48.179" end="48.410">こ</span><span begin="48.410" end="48.641">で</span><span begin="48.641" end="48.892">泣</span><span begin="48.892" end="49.306">こっ</span><span begin="49.306" end="49.576">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">好久不见了呢 如果能说出来 那会当场哭出来吧</span></p><p begin="49.731" end="52.819" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.731" end="49.955">好</span><span begin="49.955" end="50.185">き</span><span begin="50.185" end="50.404">と</span><span begin="50.404" end="50.860">かっ</span><span begin="50.860" end="51.280">て</span> <span begin="51.280" end="51.796">嫌</span><span begin="51.796" end="51.931">い</span><span begin="51.931" end="52.127">と</span><span begin="52.127" end="52.596">かっ</span><span begin="52.596" end="52.819">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无论喜欢 还是讨厌</span></p><p begin="53.041" end="56.563" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.041" end="53.496">何</span><span begin="53.496" end="53.704">度</span><span begin="53.704" end="54.124">だっ</span><span begin="54.124" end="54.370">て</span><span begin="54.370" end="54.826">愛</span><span begin="54.826" end="54.988">を</span><span begin="54.988" end="55.471">歌</span><span begin="55.471" end="55.672">う</span><span 