40.747">ま</span><span begin="3:40.747" end="3:40.954">で</span><span begin="3:40.954" end="3:41.461">に</span><span begin="3:41.461" end="3:41.631">あ</span><span begin="3:41.631" end="3:42.067">り</span><span begin="3:42.067" end="3:42.475">が</span><span begin="3:42.475" end="3:42.625">と</span><span begin="3:42.625" end="3:43.474">う</span> <span begin="3:43.651" end="3:43.831">い</span><span begin="3:43.831" end="3:44.077">つ</span><span begin="3:44.077" end="3:44.293">ま</span><span begin="3:44.293" end="3:44.494">で</span><span begin="3:44.494" end="3:44.932">も</span><span begin="3:44.932" end="3:45.550">君</span><span begin="3:45.550" end="3:46.036">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">至今为止非常感谢 希望还能与你感慨</span></p><p begin="3:46.036" end="3:57.544" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:46.036" end="3:46.726">「こん</span><span begin="3:46.726" end="3:47.128">な</span><span begin="3:47.128" end="3:47.796">歌</span><span begin="3:47.796" end="3:48.235">あっ</span><span begin="3:48.235" end="3:48.658">た</span><span begin="3:48.658" end="3:49.108">ね」っ</span><span begin="3:49.108" end="3:49.536">て</span><span begin="3:49.536" end="3:49.756">出</span><span begin="3:49.756" end="3:50.181">会</span><span begin="3:50.181" end="3:50.637">い</span><span begin="3:50.637" end="3:51.516">を</span><span begin="3:51.516" end="3:52.408">数</span><span begin="3:52.408" end="3:52.829">え</span><span begin="3:52.829" end="3:53.234">ら</span><span begin="3:53.234" end="3:53.441">れ</span><span begin="3:53.441" end="3:53.686">る</span><span begin="3:53.686" end="3:53.952">よ</span><span begin="3:53.952" end="3:54.137">う</span><span begin="3:54.137" end="3:57.544">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">「还能有这样的歌啊」还能细数这样的相遇</span></p></div></body></tt>